{"parse":{"text":"<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru inf-form-of\">насы́титься</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;act&#124;part-form-of\">насы́тившийся</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru past&#124;adv&#124;part-form-of\">насы́тившись</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́щусь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тишься</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;s&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тится</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 1&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тимся</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́титесь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 3&#124;p&#124;fut&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тятся</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;s&#124;imp-form-of\">насы́ться</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru 2&#124;p&#124;imp-form-of\">насы́тьтесь</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru m&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тился</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru p&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тились</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru f&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тилась</i>\n<i class=\"Cyrl form-of lang-ru n&#124;s&#124;past&#124;ind-form-of\">насы́тилось</i>\n<abbr title=\"perfective aspect\">\nindeclinable"}}